{
  "bookId": "rewind-51",
  "id": "chapter-211",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41810001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "深夜，郊外密林中。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "参赛者甲",
          "text": "呜，我只不过路过好奇去报了个格斗比赛，为什么会变成这个样子？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "参赛者乙",
          "text": "笨蛋，小声点！那「怪物」就在附近，被发现的话我们就完蛋了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘黑影",
          "text": "抓到你们了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘黑影",
          "text": "既然被称作「怪物」，那便合你们的意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "参赛者甲",
          "text": "我错了，我不该乱讲话……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "参赛者甲",
          "text": "呃，好想倒退到5分钟前掐死我自己……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘黑影",
          "text": "靠近太阳，是会被灼烧的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘黑影",
          "text": "可悲的造物，这就是你们注定的命运。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>IFF状态更新，目标被【希塔】锁定为【高威胁个体】。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘黑影",
          "text": "哦？有趣。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "第一波攻击结束，蓄力准备。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "「帕拉斯」，开火。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神秘黑影",
          "text": "哼，不自量力。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "追踪目标，别让他跑了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>警告：机体过热，射击精度下降至82%。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>警告：雷达回波未识别，目标丢失。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……未识别？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810019",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "十分钟后——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "奇了怪了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "按照校长的指示，应该就是这附近才对。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "阳子姐别心急，我们在附近找找看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "啊，快看那边的草地……似乎有被灼烧的痕迹！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "哈，小结月的眼镜原来不只是摆设啊~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "……阳子姐，你这样的夸奖听起来一点都不让人觉得开心哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "片刻后，阳子和结月仔细查看了现场。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "我仔细对比过了，这里的痕迹和校长说的分毫不差。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "那还等什么，快追！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41810029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "阳子姐等等，我们等先联系校长，第一时间把这里的情况告诉她。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1042",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "mikage",
          "rowIds": [
