      "title": "乱象频生·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41813001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "郊外，森林一角。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "这里……是什么地方……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "……我为什么会在这里……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "头好疼……难道又发生「那件事」了么……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "突然，林间传来窸窣的脚步声。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "谁？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "哼，原来是你们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "好久没见到你这副臭脸，我还真有点不习惯呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "行了，别闹别扭了，快跟我们回去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "在你不在的这段时间，发生了一些不好的事情。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "御景熏校长现在正派人到处找你，快跟我们回去吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "……告诉她，我不想回去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "不对，现在不是你想不想的问题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "我们知道手办灼烧事件不是你有意促成的，但你有责任在找到解决办法前，配合校长的一切安排。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "毕竟回到「圣阳贵族学院」，回到校长的身边，你才能真正获得安全。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "那样的话，和监禁有什么不同？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "祸是我闯的，我会负责。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "其他的事，不必多说。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星野结月",
          "text": "可是校长她……你姐姐真的很担心你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "……你们走吧，不要再来烦我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "这个臭小子，要不是看在校长的份上我早揍他了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "你休想再……摆布我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "这次……不会让你得逞的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "呵，容器就该有容器的觉悟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "也对，你姐姐没告诉过你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41813026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "在绝对力量面前，挣扎是徒劳的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1045",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "mikage",
          "rowIds": [
            41813001,
