      "title": "乱象频生·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41814001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "深夜郊外，密林深处。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "火焚毁一切，又创造一切。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "这就是，造物无法直视的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "神明之威严。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "此时此刻，另外一边。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "锁定目标，开始进攻。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>警告：雷达无法捕捉目标，切换到视觉识别。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "别着急，我可以用冰封魔法冻住目标。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "希塔小姐，注意你的背后！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "哼，妄想与神比肩。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "「帕拉斯」，就是现在。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>解除开火限制，调整输出功率上限至最大。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "一群自不量力的造物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "对方被我们激怒了，大家小心！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814015",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "半小时后——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……还不到最后，再来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>警告：激光发生器出现故障，输出功率下降至30%。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "造物是如此可悲，尔等怎会到现在都不清醒？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814019",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "天照转身的一瞬间，希塔敏锐地察觉到了对方的破绽。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "「帕拉斯」，最后一击，开火！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "……哼，这副「容器」的身体，果然会有极限。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "天照",
          "text": "呵，对神不敬，必遭不幸。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "不管你是什么，都要被带走调查。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "希塔小姐，你看起来很疲倦，要不要……啊，小心！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814025",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "黑暗中飞来一支神秘物件，毫无防备的希塔差点中招。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……「帕拉斯」，注意警戒，寻找袭击者。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>警告：红外线夜视仪未能发现任何目标。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "果然，我们上当了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "刚才偷袭我的方式很少见，我怀疑是某种古老的术式造成的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41814030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "没错，当前的M城中，只有「圣阳贵族学院」的御景熏校长具备此项能力。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
